    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You follow the philosophy of the Prophecies of Kalistrade, seeking to build up your wealth in this life so that you might meet the next world on your own terms.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Kalistrade Lore skill. You gain the Bargain Hunter skill feat."
    },
